# Golden files are compared byte for byte against what the code generates,
# and the generators always emit LF. GitHub's windows-latest runners ship
# core.autocrlf=true, so without this every golden file and committed fuzz
# corpus entry is rewritten to CRLF on checkout and the comparison fails on
# Windows only. The tree is text throughout, so it is all checked out as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
